resources/formats/drivel.html:10:21: [1] "quick as lightning" -> Cliché: say it in your own words.
resources/formats/drivel.html:15:19: [2] "software program" -> Redundant: “program” says it.
resources/formats/drivel.html:20:5: [3] "hopefully" -> Skunked term: rephrase to avoid it.
resources/formats/drivel.html:21:20: [4] "FIX THIS" -> Draft note: resolve it, then remove it.
resources/formats/drivel.html:27:14: [5] "Female booksalesman" -> Gendered term: use a neutral one.
resources/formats/drivel.html:32:11: [6] "synergy" -> Avoid corporate-speak.
resources/formats/drivel.html:39:9: [7] "is is" -> Repeated word: delete one.
resources/formats/drivel.html:39:29: [8] "leverage" -> Prefer: use.
